WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:04.590
File No. 1007.

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:17.280
The Knights of Hanoi are 
not only in the network.

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:22.040
They’re also affecting the real world.

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:26.570
They’re real people.

00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:31.770
Yusaku and I don’t know 
when we'll be in danger.

00:00:31.770 --> 00:00:37.120
So just in case, I’m writing this report.

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:41.090
- Kusanagi Report -

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.850
I run Across the universe

00:00:58.990 --> 00:01:02.020
At the speed of light

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:03.890
Begin Loading

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:07.630
Open the door of dreams

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:11.200
VRAINS spreads

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:14.300
Believe in myself

00:01:14.540 --> 00:01:17.840
VRAINS continues

00:01:18.070 --> 00:01:23.150
The circuit draws the future

00:01:23.410 --> 00:01:27.220
I'll grab it with my own hands  Yeah

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:28.820
Access!

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:31.520
Start swirling, Data Storm!

00:01:31.790 --> 00:01:33.120
I'm now With the Wind

00:01:33.290 --> 00:01:35.420
Link with my soul

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:38.190
Speed up, Data Storm!

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:39.930
Now Win the Race

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:42.770
Connected world

00:01:43.030 --> 00:01:46.270
No matter when

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:49.640
Nothing is impossible

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:53.780
Strive for hope

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:58.350
And ride the wind!

00:02:13.950 --> 00:02:18.990
Ten years ago, someone 
kidnapped my younger brother.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:23.050
It was known as the "Lost Incident."

00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:30.090
Yusaku was also one of the 
six kidnapped children.

00:02:32.330 --> 00:02:37.180
Each child was imprisoned separately.

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:42.040
Only VR equipment was in the room.

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:46.720
The VR showed a duel arena.

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:50.720
The children were forced to duel.

00:02:51.530 --> 00:02:52.750
You lose!

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:09.950
They could only eat, sleep and duel.

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:12.370
This repeated day after day.

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:13.910
You lose!

00:03:16.100 --> 00:03:21.650
Everything was based on dueling.

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:27.690
If you don’t win your duel, you can't eat.

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:34.340
But half a year later…

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:41.460
You can go home.

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:44.290
You gave it your all.

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:56.570
The children were suddenly rescued.

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:06.020
But since that day, my brother 
has closed his heart.

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:16.030
Learning that a hacker group known as 
the Knights of Hanoi were involved...

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:18.210
...Yusaku and I teamed up.

00:04:18.210 --> 00:04:21.510
To learn the truth about the 
Lost Incident ten years ago...

00:04:21.510 --> 00:04:24.010
...we went after the Knights of Hanoi.

00:04:26.020 --> 00:04:28.120
Linkslayer attacks!

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:29.680
Meteor Slash!

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:36.920
Why do you oppose the Hanoi?

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:38.400
Who are you?

00:04:41.220 --> 00:04:46.800
Wherever the Knights of Hanoi 
cause chaos, I'll be there.

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:51.050
My name is... Playmaker!

00:04:51.830 --> 00:04:56.980
That’s when we learned about 
an AI program named Ignis...

00:04:56.980 --> 00:04:58.760
...who was fleeing from the Knights of Hanoi

00:04:58.760 --> 00:05:02.350
and SOL Technologies, 
administrator of LINK VRAINS.

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:05.430
Found you, Ignis!

00:05:05.850 --> 00:05:09.860
Where's an escape route?  Where?

00:05:10.130 --> 00:05:11.680
Finished.

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:20.400
To get leverage on the Knights of Hanoi, 
we set a trap and caught the AI.

00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:23.510
Come to me!

00:05:31.190 --> 00:05:34.690
Welcome.  You're going to be our savior.

00:05:35.090 --> 00:05:37.420
That's how we met Ai.

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:40.430
I have what you're looking for.

00:05:40.950 --> 00:05:43.430
Stop attacking LINK VRAINS.

00:05:43.430 --> 00:05:47.500
If you don't, I'll erase it right now!

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:49.290
Hey hey hey!

00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:51.940
Don't treat your savior as a hostage!

00:05:51.940 --> 00:05:55.780
I converted this program into a duel program.

00:05:55.780 --> 00:05:59.510
If you want it, you have 
to defeat me in a duel.

00:05:59.510 --> 00:06:01.180
Fine!

00:06:01.180 --> 00:06:05.480
You'll learn what happens 
when you oppose the Hanoi!

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:07.600
This isn't good.

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:09.280
His dragon is strong.

00:06:09.280 --> 00:06:11.590
You can't win with your current deck.

00:06:11.590 --> 00:06:13.350
Oh really?

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:16.070
If I lose, you'll fall into Hanoi's hands.

00:06:16.070 --> 00:06:19.030
You should pray that I win.

00:06:19.030 --> 00:06:21.160
AIs don't pray.

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:24.000
We only calculate how to win!

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:27.230
Release Cyberse's data material!

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:40.360
This wind...  This is a Speed Duel?

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:52.680
The Data Storm will swallow 
you.  You're terminated.

00:06:57.290 --> 00:07:01.230
Never-before-seen monsters 
live inside this Data Storm.

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:03.400
Never-before-seen monsters?

00:07:03.720 --> 00:07:07.150
Now's the time to use 
your Skill, Storm Access!

00:07:07.600 --> 00:07:10.140
There's no other way for us to survive!

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:16.050
When you have 1000 or fewer LP...

00:07:16.050 --> 00:07:19.940
...Storm Access lets you access 
one random card in the Data Storm!

00:07:20.270 --> 00:07:22.690
Seize the wind, Playmaker!

00:07:31.480 --> 00:07:32.160
Now!

00:07:32.480 --> 00:07:34.360
Storm Access!

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:40.600
Link Summon!

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:44.720
Appear, Link 3 Decode Talker!

00:07:49.850 --> 00:07:51.880
Go, Decode Talker!

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:53.990
Decode End!

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:10.690
You have no right to call yourself a duelist!

00:08:12.690 --> 00:08:17.330
If SOL Technologies and the Knights
 of Hanoi are both after the AI,

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:19.740
it must be hiding a secret.

00:08:20.590 --> 00:08:23.550
We tried to analyze Ai’s data.

00:08:23.550 --> 00:08:28.990
But since it was programmed with an 
unknown algorithm, we didn't learn much.

00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:32.820
But from the small amount of 
video that we could analyze...

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:35.790
...we identified Hanoi’s leader.

00:08:38.340 --> 00:08:39.770
Who's that?

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:44.000
What?

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:48.050
I sense Ignis!

00:08:49.910 --> 00:08:51.450
Kusanagi, cut the power!

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:52.220
Right!

00:08:56.650 --> 00:08:58.230
Hey, Yusaku!

00:09:32.830 --> 00:09:34.200
What happened?

00:09:34.200 --> 00:09:36.280
He just passed by.

00:09:36.280 --> 00:09:37.080
Who?

00:09:37.440 --> 00:09:39.330
The guy inside Ai's memories.

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:42.330
Did he sense what we were doing?

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:43.640
Probably.

00:09:46.010 --> 00:09:48.270
What was that video?

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:49.840
Answer me!

00:09:50.170 --> 00:09:51.530
Sound is working now.

00:09:51.530 --> 00:09:55.120
If you won't answer, I'll 
break apart your program.

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:57.610
And you will be erased.

00:09:57.610 --> 00:10:00.320
Fine fine!  I'll talk!

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:04.710
But as I said before, most 
of my memories are damaged.

00:10:04.710 --> 00:10:06.960
Or more precisely, Hanoi took them.

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:09.040
I only have a few memories left.

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:10.520
Who was in that video?

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:12.500
Revolver.

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:14.540
Who's that?

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:15.730
Don't get shocked.

00:10:15.730 --> 00:10:18.200
He's the leader of the Knights of Hanoi!

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:20.690
Leader of Hanoi?

00:10:21.060 --> 00:10:25.090
That was our first contact with Revolver.

00:10:27.930 --> 00:10:29.560
Revolver…

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:38.360
The Knights of Hanoi’s leader, Revolver.

00:10:39.310 --> 00:10:43.990
I thought we'd be the 
ones to go and meet him.

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:48.940
But unexpectedly, Revolver 
challenged us to a duel.

00:10:50.050 --> 00:10:51.770
Let Playmaker go.

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:55.070
I’ll be the one to face him.

00:10:55.070 --> 00:11:00.740
We put a computer virus into 
your sister, Blue Angel.

00:11:00.950 --> 00:11:01.640
What?

00:11:02.920 --> 00:11:08.350
If Playmaker defeats me in a duel, 
I'll give you the removal program.

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:11.780
Playmaker.

00:11:12.110 --> 00:11:14.620
What I did to you was horrible.

00:11:14.620 --> 00:11:17.340
But for my sister, you'll still...

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:21.620
You’ll still fight for me 
even though you should hate me?

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:24.640
I don’t hate you.

00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:28.750
I only hate the Knights of Hanoi.

00:11:29.130 --> 00:11:33.380
Here we go!  The hellish duel now begins!

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:38.480
I can hear the pulse of the unknown 
power hiding in the network.

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:42.920
You’re waiting for me to capture you.

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:46.320
Come, Data Storm!

00:11:51.420 --> 00:11:53.260
I activate my Skill!

00:11:53.260 --> 00:11:56.270
The new breath resides in my hand!

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:58.040
Storm Access!

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:03.950
This power is good.

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:09.020
Appear, Link 4 Topologic Bomber Dragon!

00:12:11.110 --> 00:12:12.550
This is bad.

00:12:12.800 --> 00:12:17.290
There’s only one way we can win.

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:19.620
Storm Access.

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:24.090
Sorry, but I won’t let you use that card.

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:26.000
Full Overlap!

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:41.370
Playmaker and Revolver’s duel 
couldn’t be settled in a Speed Duel.

00:12:41.370 --> 00:12:44.990
So they moved on to the 
next stage - a Master Duel.

00:12:46.210 --> 00:12:49.820
Now I'll continue this duel and end you!

00:12:50.170 --> 00:12:51.640
Here I go, Playmaker!

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:55.640
My new wind that pierces 
through the closed world!

00:12:55.640 --> 00:12:56.830
Link Summon!

00:12:56.830 --> 00:13:01.240
Appear, Link 4 Borreload Dragon!

00:13:10.540 --> 00:13:13.580
It's his ace monster!

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:19.710
Due to Fire Prison’s effect, your 
Cyberse monsters have vanished!

00:13:19.910 --> 00:13:22.380
Go, Borreload Dragon!

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:25.320
Attack Playmaker directly!

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:28.460
Take this!

00:13:28.460 --> 00:13:31.120
Thunder Varrel Cannon!

00:13:38.610 --> 00:13:42.570
If I don’t do something this 
turn, I'll definitely lose.

00:13:42.930 --> 00:13:45.070
But what can I do?

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:50.490
This is…

00:13:54.450 --> 00:14:00.680
The new pulse of the Cyberse inside 
my deck hasn't vanished yet.

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:03.100
Whatever you try is pointless.

00:14:03.100 --> 00:14:05.660
Cyberses are already gone.

00:14:09.230 --> 00:14:10.510
You’re wrong.

00:14:10.510 --> 00:14:14.430
Cyberses are still here.

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:16.880
I can hear their pulses!

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:21.120
Appear, Link 4!

00:14:21.530 --> 00:14:23.950
Firewall Dragon!

00:14:34.590 --> 00:14:36.800
Fire Prison is destroyed.

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:41.210
I won’t lose.

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:45.500
I have three reasons why I must defeat you!

00:14:46.170 --> 00:14:52.150
#1: I'll defeat you and uncover the 
truth about what happened ten years ago!

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:57.740
#2: I'll regain the time that I lost!

00:14:57.740 --> 00:15:02.400
#3: I'll save my friend who saved me!

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:05.360
Ten years ago…  Three things…

00:15:06.060 --> 00:15:09.600
You’re the one from that 
incident ten years ago?

00:15:09.950 --> 00:15:11.610
That’s right.

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:14.680
I'm that emissary of revenge!

00:15:17.660 --> 00:15:20.060
There’s only one thing I must do.

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:25.470
I'll crush the Knights of 
Hanoi and learn everything!

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:28.200
Firewall attacks!

00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:30.410
Tempest Attack!

00:15:31.790 --> 00:15:35.960
Borreload can’t be destroyed, 
but you take damage!

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:46.990
Hey!  Trying to escape?

00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:49.150
I keep my promises.

00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:51.760
Take it.

00:15:53.410 --> 00:15:55.100
It's the removal program.

00:15:55.480 --> 00:15:56.780
Playmaker!

00:15:57.390 --> 00:16:00.050
The wind didn't blow for me today.

00:16:00.050 --> 00:16:06.510
But as long as you have that AI, 
this duel was the only the start.

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:08.980
We will meet again.

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:13.760
Revolver hasn’t shown himself since.

00:16:14.190 --> 00:16:17.630
That makes me worry.

00:16:18.670 --> 00:16:21.540
What is he secretly doing?

00:16:21.970 --> 00:16:30.380
When he shows up again, that could be X Day 
- a major event that will affect our destiny.

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:34.350
But we have allies.

00:16:34.350 --> 00:16:35.740
And!

00:16:38.950 --> 00:16:41.820
I make a heel turn!

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:47.490
My name is now Dark Onizuka!

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:59.810
By changing his fighting style, 
Go Onizuka raised his potential.

00:17:00.110 --> 00:17:01.530
Link Summon!

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:08.480
Appear, Link 4 Gouki The Master Ogre!

00:17:08.910 --> 00:17:10.440
Link 4?

00:17:13.190 --> 00:17:14.820
This is the end!

00:17:14.820 --> 00:17:16.720
The Master Ogre!

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:20.390
Go!  Attack Gothiclone!

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:46.210
I was screaming from the bottomless 
darkness during that incident.

00:17:47.970 --> 00:17:54.010
While I felt like I was going to be crushed 
by heavy sadness, fear and despair...

00:17:54.010 --> 00:17:56.190
...I kept screaming with all my might.

00:17:56.810 --> 00:18:00.280
A sorrowful scream that no one could hear.

00:18:00.280 --> 00:18:06.150
Many people who've been turned into 
Anothers are enduring the same pain.

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:09.600
I'll never forgive you!

00:18:10.130 --> 00:18:12.640
Blue Angel once left the battlefield.

00:18:12.640 --> 00:18:17.220
But after learning what dueling 
really meant, she came back.

00:18:20.770 --> 00:18:26.160
Appear, Link 4 Trickstar Bella Madonna!

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:31.730
Battle!

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:36.710
Trickstar Bella Madonna attacks 
Dark Mummy Surgical Forceps!

00:18:37.040 --> 00:18:39.780
Shining Espoir!

00:18:40.290 --> 00:18:42.560
This is the power of believing!

00:18:54.470 --> 00:18:56.320
The removal program?  But why?

00:18:56.710 --> 00:18:59.290
You changed my heart.

00:19:00.960 --> 00:19:06.400
You may have fought for yourself, but 
that can change those around you.

00:19:06.930 --> 00:19:12.370
If you carry the hopes of others, 
you’re fighting for everyone.

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:15.160
For everyone?

00:19:16.560 --> 00:19:24.150
I believe they'll have the same goals 
and fight the Knights of Hanoi together.

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:32.280
By working together, they defeated Hanoi's 
three knights so there'd be no more Anothers.

00:19:32.820 --> 00:19:36.630
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:19:37.760 --> 00:19:39.530
Arrowheads confirmed!

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:42.100
The summoning conditions are three monsters!

00:19:42.100 --> 00:19:48.250
I set two Motor Worm Tokens and 
Cyberse Wizard in the Link Markers!

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:50.070
Circuit combine!

00:19:50.070 --> 00:19:51.270
Link Summon!

00:19:51.270 --> 00:19:56.110
Appear, Link 3 Powercode Talker!

00:20:01.710 --> 00:20:02.910
Break through!

00:20:02.910 --> 00:20:05.120
Power Termination Smash!

00:20:13.450 --> 00:20:17.660
But I know Revolver won't back down.

00:20:21.810 --> 00:20:28.520
The countdown to X Day 
may already have started.

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:35.040
Playmaker!

00:20:35.490 --> 00:20:39.420
Due to your actions, 
humanity’s future will be-

00:20:42.320 --> 00:20:46.050
But no matter what happens, I can say this.

00:20:46.870 --> 00:20:50.630
Jin, I’m always thinking about you.

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:55.340
You’re always in my heart.

00:20:56.080 --> 00:21:02.660
If anyone reads this report, 
please tell that to my brother.

00:21:10.470 --> 00:21:11.710
Jin…

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:14.220
Who is it?

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:18.900
Oh, Yusaku.

00:21:18.900 --> 00:21:20.660
What's up?  It’s late.

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:23.660
I feel uneasy for some reason.

00:21:23.660 --> 00:21:26.510
And that’s why he can’t sleep.

00:21:26.510 --> 00:21:28.830
Yusaku’s so cute!

00:21:29.850 --> 00:21:31.070
Be quiet.

00:21:31.070 --> 00:21:37.540
But to be honest, I also sense something bad.

00:21:38.040 --> 00:21:40.520
It’s the quiet before the storm.

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:44.480
I feel that Revolver is 
going to make his move.

00:21:44.480 --> 00:21:48.450
He holds the key to everything.

00:21:49.770 --> 00:21:52.240
The time has finally come.

00:21:53.850 --> 00:21:56.180
The Tower of Hanoi.

00:21:56.180 --> 00:22:01.030
I'll risk the fate of humanity on this game.

00:22:09.120 --> 00:22:15.940
My life is like detestably bad graffiti

00:22:16.330 --> 00:22:23.080
But when you looked at 
me, I felt I wasn't alone

00:22:23.500 --> 00:22:30.280
I'm glad that I'm alive  I truly am

00:22:30.810 --> 00:22:37.660
What I couldn't say before, I can say now

00:22:38.510 --> 00:22:44.900
Within the sadness that I kept holding down

00:22:45.290 --> 00:22:49.030
There were fragments of power

00:22:49.290 --> 00:22:56.210
No one can take away my light to the future

00:22:56.470 --> 00:23:03.550
The chronicles of life only has a few lines

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:10.760
People I meet, my regrets – they're 
all like ultramarine diamonds to me

00:23:11.010 --> 00:23:17.960
You've always confront loneliness by yourself

00:23:18.120 --> 00:23:24.840
I bet we can now laugh 
together, forever and ever

00:23:25.560 --> 00:23:32.540
Lighting Life with our invisible bond

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:39.160
The end times are near.

00:23:39.560 --> 00:23:44.970
Starting today, the real and fictional 
worlds will return to the beginning.

00:23:44.970 --> 00:23:50.680
Many will fall victim, and the 
lucky survivors will be powerless.

00:23:50.680 --> 00:23:53.680
There are no safe zones.

00:23:53.680 --> 00:23:55.850
The flow has changed.

00:23:56.160 --> 00:24:00.120
I sense that something is about to happen.

00:24:00.120 --> 00:24:03.580
